  "details": "I've run into this issue before, where I would run into people that had me blocked that I didn't know. Usually you brush it off as okay, maybe they blocked me in the past for some reason, but I like to think I don't do anything that would want someone to block me, but whatever. \n\nLast night two friends experienced it and when they tried to communicate and fix the block, which shouldn't have been there, nothing worked. After seeing this I'm beginning to think the  random block is a bug not users actually blocking each other. Usually you don't talk to random people that have you block or even notice them, so it would make sense why no one notices this.  I recorded a little bit just for context:\n\nhttps://www.youtube.com/watch?v=DYD3d-85vDE&feature=youtu.be",
